Steps to Get Your Telegram api_id and api_hash
Go to: https://my.telegram.org

1. Log in using your phone number (the same one you use with Telegram).
2. You’ll get a login code via the Telegram app.
3. Click “API Development Tools”.
4. Fill in the form:
    App title: Choose any name (e.g. MyParserApp)
    Short name: Any short identifier (e.g. parser)
    URL: You can leave this blank or put http://localhost
    Platform: Choose something like "Desktop" or "Other"
5. Once you submit the form, you'll get:
api_id
api_hash